{"type":"message","id":"63687d55","parentId":"bd5b8495","timestamp":"2026-04-12T00:00:06.931Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:0f2e06c5-425c-40b2-845b-135e47277fe1 github-repo-daily-briefing] 매일 09:00 KST 기준으로 GitHub 인기 레포 브리핑을 생성해 Sam에게 한국어로 전달하세요. 반드시 GitHub API(gh api 또는 공식 REST)로 실제 데이터를 조회하세요. 출력 형식: (1) 최근 인기 Top 5(최근 7일 생성 + stars 기준), (2) 누적 스타 상위 Top 5(archived 제외, 가능하면 최근 활동 있는 레포 우선), (3) 각 레포 핵심 설명 1~2문장(무엇/왜 중요한지), (4) OpenClaw 또는 Claude Code에 바로 적용 가능한 아이디어 3~5개(자동화/보안/개발생산성 관점), (5) 오늘 바로 실행할 액션 3개. 중복 레포는 한 번만 노출하고 전체 2500자 이내로 간결하게 작성하세요.\nCurrent time: Sunday, April 12th, 2026 - 9:00 AM (Asia/Seoul) / 2026-04-12 00:00 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775952006924}}
{"type":"message","id":"7410ffd2","parentId":"63687d55","timestamp":"2026-04-12T00:00:12.894Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has sent me a cron job instruction. Let me parse what's being asked:\n\n1. This is a daily briefing job that runs at 09:00 KST\n2. I need to create a GitHub repository briefing for Sam in Korean\n3. Must use GitHub API (gh api or official REST) to fetch real data\n4. Output format:\n   - (1) Top 5 trending repos (created in last 7 days, by stars)\n   - (2) Top 5 by total stars (excluding archived, prefer active)\n   - (3) 1-2 sentence core description for each repo (what/why important)\n   - (4) 3-5 ideas applicable to OpenClaw or Claude Code (automation/security/dev productivity)\n   - (5) 3 actions to execute today\n5. Deduplicate repos (show each only once)\n6. Keep total under 2500 characters, concise\n\nThe return should be plain text for automated delivery.\n\nI need to:\n1. Use GitHub API to fetch trending repositories\n2. Use GitHub API to fetch top repositories by stars\n3. Format the output in Korean\n4. Keep it concise and actionable\n\nLet me start by querying GitHub API. I'll need to use the `gh` CLI or make REST API calls.\n\nFor trending repos (last 7 days):\nI can use: `gh search repos --sort stars --order desc --created \"2026-04-05..2026-04-12\" --limit 20`\n\nFor top repos by stars:\nI can use: `gh search repos --sort stars --order desc --limit 20`\n\nActually, let me check if gh CLI is available first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll fetch the GitHub repository data and create the daily briefing for you."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fc5c924b36d144fcb8b3f8ee","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh search repos --sort stars --order desc --created \"2026-04-05..2026-04-12\" --limit 20 --json name,owner,description,stargazersCount,url,createdAt,primaryLanguage"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":14624,"output":774,"cacheRead":1660,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17058,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775952006937,"responseId":"20260412080009841c7806852e4d5e"}}
